- npm lint, TypeScript check, cargo fmt, cargo check, and cargo clippy passed (clippy run suppressed only the known unrelated nonminimal_bool warning in chat_prompts.rs).
- Full Rust suite: 2942 passed, 3 unrelated failures (two Windows CRLF source-comparison tests and one concurrency test that passed immediately when rerun alone), 4 ignored.
- Full npm test: frontend/build/CEF suites passed; one pre-existing Windows path expectation failed in scripts/e2e/e2e-process.test.mjs.

